      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "うちの商会の連中に、ある物を運ばせてたんだが、\n何とそいつが馬車ごと行方不明になっちまった。\n俺様直々に調査と回収に向かいたいんだが……\nどうだ？　手伝ってみる気はないか？",
        "official_en": "I had a company carriage transporting some pretty\nvaluable goods, but the men, the carriage, and the\nitems have all gone missing. Time to investigate for\nmyself. How about it? You in the mood to tag along?",
        "real_en": null
      },
