      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "万事解決だな。依頼をしておいて正解だったぜ！\n今回のことは、くれぐれも内密に頼む。\n本当に感謝してるぜ。今度そっちに何かあったら、\n俺様を呼んでくれていい。",
        "official_en": "All's well that ends well, I suppose. Turns out I was\nright to ask for your help! Just be sure to keep this\nlittle adventure between us, yes? I owe you one now.\nSo if you ever need me, just give me call.",
